# AB-034: Phosphate protonation state changes at successive base equivalents
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 H3PO4 0.001mol
add v1 NaOH 0.001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 H3PO4 0.001mol
add v2 NaOH 0.002mol
new
add v3 water 100mL
add v3 H3PO4 0.001mol
add v3 NaOH 0.0025mol
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
measure v3 ph
inspect
